(   - Student Branch Benefits: Grants access to the IEEE Xplore digital library \(>5 million) Tj
T*
(   papers\); travel grants to present papers at flagship global conferences \(ISSCC, ICC, IEDM\);) Tj
T*
(   participation in global competitions like IEEE Xtreme; networking with international research) Tj
T*
(   leaders; leadership opportunities in IEEE Student Branch executive committees.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. The Institution of Electronics and Telecommunication Engineers \(IETE\):) Tj
T*
(   - National Indian Focus: Founded in 1953, IETE is the premier national professional society in) Tj
T*
(   India dedicated to electronics, telecommunications, and IT. Recognized as a Scientific and) Tj
T*
(   Industrial Research Organization \(SIRO\) by the Government of India.) Tj
T*
(   - Student Forums: Establishes IETE Students Forums \(ISF\) in engineering colleges, conducting) Tj
T*
