T*
(   defense, aerospace, and indigenous telecom initiatives.) Tj
T*
(   - Publications: Publishes the peer-reviewed IETE Journal of Research and IETE Technical Review,) Tj
T*
(   providing an accessible national platform for undergraduate research dissemination.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. The Institution of Engineers India \(IEI\):) Tj
T*
(   - Multidisciplinary Legacy: Established in 1920 under a Royal Charter, IEI is the oldest and) Tj
T*
(   largest multi-disciplinary professional body of engineers in India.) Tj
T*
(   - Professional Accreditation: Awards the prestigious 'Chartered Engineer \(India\)' professional) Tj
T*
(   certification, highly valued in Public Sector Undertakings \(PSUs\), government civil services,) Tj
T*
(   and international consulting contracts.) Tj
T*
