(   [Problem Statement]: Deconstruct the multi-semester Capstone Engineering Design Project lifecycle, detailing problem formulation, literature survey, simulation modeling, hardware bring-up, empirical measurement, and final defense.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Phase 1: Problem Formulation, Feasibility & Literature Survey \(Months 1-2\):) Tj
T*
(   - Identifying an Authentic Engineering Problem: Formulate a problem statement addressing real) Tj
T*
(   industrial or societal pain points \(e.g., smart EV battery telemetry, low-cost biomedical) Tj
T*
(   spirometer, or 5G phased-array antenna feed\).) Tj
T*
(   - Academic Literature Survey: Conduct an exhaustive literature review on IEEE Xplore, Scopus,) Tj
T*
(   and Google Patents to map the state-of-the-art over the past 3 to 5 years, explicitly) Tj
T*
(   identifying the technical research gap that the project will solve.) Tj
T*
(   - Bill of Materials \(BOM\) & Budgeting: Identify component availability, lead times, pin) Tj
T*
(   compatibility, and ensure total BOM cost fits project budgetary constraints.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Phase 2: Architectural Design & Multi-Domain Simulation \(Months 3-4\):) Tj
T*
(   - Theoretical & Mathematical Modeling: Formulate governing equations in MATLAB or Python.) Tj
T*
(   - Simulation Before Silicon: Construct behavioral and circuit schematics in LTspice \(analog) Tj
T*
(   front-ends\), ModelSim/Vivado \(RTL digital logic\), and Ansys HFSS / CST Studio \(RF antennas\).) Tj
T*
(   Validate that circuit simulations achieve 100% functional and timing margins before ordering) Tj
T*
(   physical components.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Phase 3: Hardware Fabrication and Modular Firmware Bring-Up \(Months 5-6\):) Tj
T*
(   - Custom PCB Layout: Design multi-layer PCBs in KiCad or Altium Designer adhering to strict IPC) Tj
T*
(   design-for-manufacturing \(DFM\) rules; route controlled impedance lines; generate Gerbers and) Tj
T*
(   fabricate.) Tj
T*
(   - SMT Assembly & Power Bring-Up: Solder power management blocks first; verify clean 3.3V/1.8V) Tj
T*
(   rails with zero short circuits before populating sensitive microcontrollers.) Tj
T*
(   - Modular Firmware Drivers: Author modular C/C++ device drivers with unit tests, bringing up) Tj
T*
(   UART, SPI, I2C, and sensor interfaces sequentially.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Phase 4: System Integration & Empirical Benchmarking \(Months 7-8\):) Tj
T*
(   - Subsystem Integration: Connect analog transducers, embedded compute controllers, wireless) Tj
T*
(   modems, and power systems inside a custom 3D-printed enclosure.) Tj
T*
(   - Laboratory Measurement Validation: Measure physical signals using Digital Storage) Tj
T*
(   Oscilloscopes, Vector Network Analyzers, and Spectrum Analyzers. Compare empirical laboratory) Tj
T*
(   measurements side-by-side against simulation benchmarks, quantifying accuracy, latency, and) Tj
T*
(   power efficiency.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   5. Phase 5: Documentation, Plagiarism Signoff, and Dissemination:) Tj
T*
(   - Comprehensive Technical Report: Author detailed thesis report adhering to university) Tj
T*
(   formatting standards; pass Turnitin plagiarism check \(<10% similarity\).) Tj
T*
(   - Defense & Dissemination: Deliver a live hardware demonstration before an external evaluation) Tj
T*
(   committee; publish findings in an IEEE conference or Scopus journal; file patent application if) Tj
T*
(   novelty is established.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET

endstream
