12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Formulate the statutory framework of Intellectual Property Rights \(IPR\) in India, detailing patentability criteria under the Indian Patents Act 1970, non-patentable subject matter under Section 3, and patent filing procedures.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Core Legal Triad of Patentability:) Tj
T*
(   - Under the Indian Patents Act 1970 \(amended in 2005 to comply with WTO TRIPS\), an invention) Tj
T*
(   must satisfy three mandatory statutory tests to qualify for a patent grant:) Tj
T*
(   \(1\) Novelty: The invention must never have been published in any document, demonstrated) Tj
T*
(   publicly, or formed part of the state-of-the-art anywhere in the world prior to the filing date) Tj
T*
(   \(absolute global novelty\).) Tj
T*
(   \(2\) Inventive Step \(Non-Obviousness\): The technical advancement must not be obvious to a person) Tj
T*
(   having ordinary skill in the art \(PHOSITA\).) Tj
T*
(   \(3\) Industrial Applicability \(Utility\): The invention must be capable of being manufactured or) Tj
T*
(   used in an industry, possessing practical tangible utility.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Statutory Exclusions Under Section 3 of the Indian Patents Act:) Tj
T*
(   - Section 3 lists inventions that are NOT patentable within India:) Tj
T*
(   - Section 3\(a\): Inventions contrary to well-established natural laws \(e.g. perpetual motion) Tj
T*
(   machines\).) Tj
T*
(   - Section 3\(b\): Inventions whose primary exploitation would be contrary to public order or) Tj
T*
(   morality \(e.g. biological weapons, hacking malware\).) Tj
T*
(   - Section 3\(d\): The mere discovery of a new form of a known substance that does not result in) Tj
T*
(   enhanced therapeutic or physical efficacy.) Tj
T*
(   - Section 3\(k\): Crucial for ECE/CSE: A mathematical method, a business method, a computer) Tj
T*
(   programme per se, or algorithms are strictly non-patentable. However, if software code is) Tj
T*
(   inextricably tied to a novel physical hardware apparatus \(e.g., a novel microcontroller) Tj
T*
(   architecture, a specific radar signal processor, or a medical diagnostic circuit\), it is) Tj
T*
(   patentable as a hardware-software combination.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Step-by-Step Indian Patent Prosecution Lifecycle:) Tj
T*
(   - Step 1 \(Prior Art Search\): Search InPASS, Google Patents, and Espacenet databases.) Tj
T*
(   - Step 2 \(Filing Form 1 & Form 2\): File Provisional Specification to secure Priority Date;) Tj
T*
(   submit Complete Specification within 12 months.) Tj
T*
(   - Step 3 \(Publication\): Automatically published in the official Patent Office Journal after 18) Tj
T*
(   months \(or expedited via Form 9\).) Tj
T*
(   - Step 4 \(Request for Examination - Form 18\): Filed within 48 months \(or 31 months under new) Tj
T*
(   rules\) to trigger official examination.) Tj
T*
(   - Step 5 \(First Examination Report - FER\): Examiner issues prior art objections; applicant must) Tj
T*
(   submit written response and claim amendments within 6 months.) Tj
T*
(   - Step 6 \(Grant\): Upon satisfaction, Letters Patent are issued granting 20 years of exclusive) Tj
T*
(   statutory monopoly from filing date.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(>> Solution to Question 6:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Deconstruct the Therac-25 Medical Radiation Disaster \(1985-1987\), analyzing the software race conditions, lack of hardware interlocks, organizational negligence, and the foundational safety engineering lessons derived.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Clinical Context of the Therac-25 Machine:) Tj
T*
(   - The Therac-25 was a dual-mode medical linear accelerator designed to treat cancer patients) Tj
T*
(   using either: \(1\) Low-energy Direct Electron Therapy \(up to a few MeV\), or \(2\) High-energy) Tj
T*
(   X-Ray Therapy \(25 MeV photon mode\).) Tj
T*
(   - In high-energy X-ray mode, the electron beam current was 100 times higher than in electron) Tj
T*
(   mode. To convert electrons into X-rays and safely flatten the radiation beam, a heavy tungsten) Tj
T*
