(   target and beam-flattening filter was physically swung into the beam path between the) Tj
T*
(   accelerator source and the patient.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. The Software Race Condition and Failure Mechanism:) Tj
T*
(   - Elimination of Hardware Interlocks: In earlier Therac-6 and Therac-20 models, physical) Tj
T*
(   electromechanical switches and relays physically prevented the high-power 25 MeV beam from) Tj
T*
(   firing unless the heavy tungsten filter was confirmed in position. In the Therac-25, engineers) Tj
T*
(   eliminated all hardware interlocks to reduce manufacturing costs, relying 100% on software) Tj
T*
(   checks.) Tj
T*
(   - Concurrent Software Bug \(Race Condition\): The PDP-11 assembly code executed multi-tasking) Tj
T*
(   routines without proper mutex locks. When experienced technicians rapidly typed treatment) Tj
T*
(   parameters \('X' for X-ray, followed immediately by up-arrow edit and carriage return\),) Tj
T*
(   execution bypassed parameter verification.) Tj
T*
(   - Shared Counter Roll-Over: An 8-bit shared variable counter incremented every time parameter) Tj
T*
(   setup occurred. When the counter reached 255 and incremented by 1, it rolled over to 0 \(integer) Tj
T*
(   overflow\). The software interpreted counter value 0 as 'interlocks verified and beam ready!'.) Tj
T*
(   - The Catastrophe: The machine fired the full-power 25 MeV electron beam directly into patients) Tj
T*
(   without the tungsten attenuator in place. Six cancer patients received massive, lethal) Tj
T*
(   radiation overdoses \(up to 20,000 rads?thousands of times the safe dose\), resulting in) Tj
T*
(   excruciating deaths and catastrophic injuries.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Essential Safety and Systems Engineering Lessons:) Tj
T*
(   - Defense-in-Depth & Physical Interlocks: In safety-critical systems \(aerospace, automotive,) Tj
T*
(   medical\), software algorithms must NEVER be the sole fail-safe. Independent, hardwired physical) Tj
T*
(   interlocks must exist that physically prevent catastrophic states regardless of software bugs.) Tj
T*
(   - Eliminating Shared Concurrency Hazards: Atomic operations, thread synchronization primitives,) Tj
T*
(   and formal verification of multi-threaded race conditions are mandatory.) Tj
T*
(   - Fail-Safe Defaults: Any system error or unexpected parameter change must immediately default) Tj
T*
(   to a safe, unpowered shutdown state.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
