(   [Problem Statement]: Deconstruct the architecture, legal requirements, and drafting methodology of a Complete Patent Specification under the Indian Patents Act, detailing abstract, drawings, detailed description, and claims.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Legal Nature of the Patent Specification \(Form 2\):) Tj
T*
(   - A patent specification is a specialized legal-technical document that serves a dual mandate:) Tj
T*
(   \(1\) It must provide a full, clear, and concise disclosure of the invention enabling a Person) Tj
T*
(   Having Ordinary Skill in the Art \(PHOSITA\) to replicate the hardware without undue) Tj
T*
(   experimentation \(Enabling Disclosure\); and \(2\) It defines the strict legal monopoly boundaries) Tj
T*
(   granted to the patentee \(Claims\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Mandatory Structural Sections of Form 2:) Tj
T*
(   - Title of Invention: Clear, concise description \(max 15 words\) reflecting technical subject) Tj
T*
(   matter without promotional language.) Tj
T*
(   - Field of Invention & Prior Art Background: Describes the technical domain and reviews) Tj
T*
(   shortcomings, bottlenecks, and limitations of existing published technologies, establishing the) Tj
T*
(   unsolved problem.) Tj
T*
(   - Objectives of the Invention: Explicitly states the primary technical advantages achieved by) Tj
T*
(   the proposed apparatus or method.) Tj
T*
(   - Summary of the Invention: Summarizes essential structural elements and functional mechanisms.) Tj
T*
(   - Brief Description of the Drawings: Explains labeled callout numbers corresponding to) Tj
T*
(   schematic circuit diagrams, block diagrams, and operational flowcharts.) Tj
T*
(   - Detailed Description: Provides comprehensive, granular explanation of circuit topologies,) Tj
T*
(   microcontroller pin configurations, firmware state machines, and experimental test results.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. The Claims Section - The Heart of the Patent:) Tj
T*
(   - Claims legally delineate the boundaries of monopoly: What is not claimed is disclaimed!) Tj
T*
(   - Independent Claims: Broadest standalone claim containing all essential inventive elements:) Tj
T*
(   'We claim: 1. An ultra-low power wireless sensor node apparatus comprising: a bio-potential) Tj
T*
(   analog front-end circuit... a microcontroller core... an energy harvesting circuit...'.) Tj
T*
(   - Dependent Claims: Narrower claims referencing the independent claim, adding specific) Tj
T*
(   technical embodiments: '2. The apparatus of claim 1, wherein the bio-potential front-end) Tj
T*
(   comprises an instrumentation amplifier having a CMRR exceeding 100 dB...'. If an independent) Tj
T*
(   claim is invalidated by prior art, valid dependent claims survive to maintain patent) Tj
T*
(   protection.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
ET

endstream
