T*
(   1. The Ethical Horizon of Autonomous Systems:) Tj
T*
(   - As electronics and communication engineering converges with machine learning, algorithms) Tj
T*
(   increasingly make autonomous decisions that directly impact human liberty, safety, and) Tj
T*
(   life?ranging from autonomous driving and biometric facial surveillance to automated lethal) Tj
T*
(   defense robotics.) Tj
