T*
(   dignity, or fundamental privacy rights.) Tj
T*
(   \(2\) Well-Being: Technology must prioritize human flourishing and environmental sustainability) Tj
T*
(   over pure algorithmic efficiency.) Tj
T*
(   \(3\) Accountability & Traceability: Algorithmic decisions must possess clear human) Tj
