(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the role and architecture of an Undergraduate Research Paper Presentation in an IEEE International Conference, detailing abstract formulation, peer review stages, camera-ready preparation, and oral defense.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Academic Value of Conference Publication for Undergraduates:) Tj
T*
(   - Presenting an original research paper at a peer-reviewed IEEE international conference) Tj
T*
(   provides undergraduate engineering students with invaluable experience in scholarly technical) Tj
T*
(   writing, rigorous peer critique, and public defense before the global scientific community. It) Tj
T*
(   substantially strengthens applications for premier corporate R&D roles and international MS/PhD) Tj
T*
(   fellowships.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. The Conference Submission and Review Pipeline:) Tj
T*
(   - Manuscript Preparation: Authored according to strict standard IEEE 2-column formatting) Tj
T*
(   templates \(LaTeX or Word\). Must clearly define: \(1\) Abstract, \(2\) Introduction & Research Gap,) Tj
T*
(   \(3\) Proposed Circuit/System Architecture, \(4\) Mathematical Formulation & Simulation, \(5\)) Tj
T*
(   Empirical Hardware Experimental Results, and \(6\) Conclusion.) Tj
T*
(   - Double-Blind / Single-Blind Peer Review: Technical Program Committee \(TPC\) assigns the) Tj
T*
(   manuscript to 3 independent expert reviewers who evaluate originality, technical soundness,) Tj
T*
(   mathematical rigor, experimental validation, and clarity of English.) Tj
T*
(   - Decision Categories: Accepted without changes, Accepted with Mandatory Revisions, or) Tj
T*
(   Rejected.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Camera-Ready Preparation and Oral Defense:) Tj
T*
(   - Incorporating Reviewer Feedback: Authors must meticulously address reviewer critiques and) Tj
T*
(   revise text and diagrams accordingly.) Tj
T*
(   - IEEE PDF eXpress Compliance: Verifying that PDF fonts are fully embedded and compliant with) Tj
T*
(   IEEE archival standards.) Tj
T*
(   - Electronic Copyright Form \(eCF\): Legally transferring publication distribution rights to) Tj
T*
(   IEEE.) Tj
T*
(   - In-Person / Virtual Oral Defense: Delivering a 15-minute professional slide presentation) Tj
T*
(   followed by a 5-minute rigorous technical Q&A session defending design methodologies before) Tj
T*
(   academic peers.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
