(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze the structural organization and technical mandates of University Capstone Project Evaluation Panels, detailing rubric weightages, viva defense, poster demonstrations, and industry panel review.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Multi-Stage Capstone Evaluation Architecture:) Tj
T*
(   - The final-year Capstone Engineering Project is the definitive academic milestone measuring) Tj
T*
(   whether an undergraduate student has attained the graduate attributes mandated by global) Tj
T*
(   accreditation bodies \(such as the Washington Accord and National Board of Accreditation - NBA\).) Tj
T*
(   - Evaluation is structured across three formal milestones: \(1\) Preliminary Proposal Review) Tj
T*
(   \(15%\), \(2\) Mid-Term Progress Review \(25%\), and \(3\) Final Comprehensive Defense and) Tj
T*
(   Demonstration \(60%\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Objective Rubric Decomposition:) Tj
T*
(   - Rubric 1: Problem Formulation & Literature Quality \(15%\): Evaluates clarity of engineering) Tj
T*
(   problem, depth of IEEE literature review, and clear identification of unsolved research gaps.) Tj
T*
(   - Rubric 2: System Architecture & Simulation Rigor \(20%\): Evaluates mathematical modeling,) Tj
T*
(   schematic design quality, and completeness of LTspice, Vivado, or MATLAB simulations.) Tj
T*
(   - Rubric 3: Working Hardware Prototype & Craftsmanship \(35%\): Evaluates physical) Tj
T*
(   implementation?custom multi-layer PCB design quality, soldering integrity, robust industrial) Tj
T*
(   enclosure, and reliable live demonstration under real-world conditions.) Tj
T*
(   - Rubric 4: Empirical Measurement & Benchmark Validation \(15%\): Compares measured lab data \(DSO) Tj
T*
(   waveforms, VNA S-parameters, battery current draw\) side-by-side against theoretical) Tj
T*
(   calculations.) Tj
T*
(   - Rubric 5: Technical Report & Oral Defense \(15%\): Assesses report formatting, Turnitin) Tj
T*
(   plagiarism index \(<10%\), quality of technical slides/posters, and individual ability to answer) Tj
T*
(   panel questions during technical viva voce.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. External Industry Panel Review:) Tj
T*
(   - Senior engineering directors from semiconductor and telecommunications companies participate) Tj
T*
(   as external jury examiners, validating that student projects satisfy contemporary industrial) Tj
T*
(   engineering standards.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
