(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze the structural organization, specialized equipment, and research scope of a Microprocessor and Embedded Controllers Laboratory in an ECE department.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Purpose of the Embedded Controllers Laboratory:) Tj
T*
(   - The Microprocessor and Embedded Controllers Laboratory bridges theoretical computer) Tj
T*
(   architecture \(ALU datapaths, instruction decoding, memory segmentation\) with real-world) Tj
T*
(   low-level firmware engineering and physical peripheral interfacing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Laboratory Bench Hardware Resources:) Tj
T*
(   - Microcontroller Training Boards: Legacy 8085/8086 microprocessor trainer kits \(to teach) Tj
T*
(   machine-level assembly, opcode decoding, and hardware timing diagrams\), alongside modern 32-bit) Tj
T*
(   ARM Cortex-M development platforms \(STM32 Nucleo, NXP LPC, TI Tiva C\).) Tj
T*
(   - Peripheral Interfacing Modules: Standalone daughterboards containing 4x4 matrix keypads, 16x2) Tj
T*
(   character LCDs, 7-segment LED displays, stepper motor and DC motor H-bridge drivers, optical) Tj
T*
(   rotary encoders, ultrasonic distance sensors, and I2C/SPI temperature sensors.) Tj
T*
(   - Debugging & Analysis Tools: Multi-channel USB logic analyzers, Segger J-Link JTAG/SWD) Tj
T*
(   hardware in-circuit emulators, and digital oscilloscopes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Pedagogical Curriculum Progression:) Tj
T*
(   - Phase 1 \(Assembly & Machine Fundamentals\): Understanding register sets, memory segmentation,) Tj
T*
(   flags, and authoring assembly code for arithmetic, block transfers, and delay loops.) Tj
T*
(   - Phase 2 \(Bare-Metal Embedded C & Memory-Mapped Registers\): Configuring GPIO direction,) Tj
T*
(   pull-up resistors, timers in PWM mode, and ADC conversions without using high-level libraries.) Tj
T*
(   - Phase 3 \(Interrupts & Communication Protocols\): Authoring non-blocking interrupt-driven UART,) Tj
T*
(   SPI, and I2C drivers with circular FIFO buffers.) Tj
T*
(   - Phase 4 \(Real-Time OS Integration\): Porting FreeRTOS onto the ARM core, creating independent) Tj
T*
(   preemptive tasks, and managing inter-task communication via queues and semaphores.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
