(   [Problem Statement]: Synthesize the overarching philosophy of Professional Engineering Ethics, Personal Integrity, and Lifelong Academic Responsibility as the foundational compass for a graduating Electronics and Communication Engineer.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Noble Calling of the Professional Engineer:) Tj
T*
(   - Engineering is fundamentally not merely a technical occupation or a commercial trade; it is a) Tj
T*
(   profound societal trust. Electronics and Communication Engineers design the silicon microchips) Tj
T*
(   that guide commercial aircraft, control medical pacemakers, manage high-voltage energy grids,) Tj
T*
(   process global financial transactions, and connect distant societies.) Tj
T*
